2 CONC  Ant. Iud. 16,7,6; 17,1,3; 18,5,4). Wandrey, Irina (Berlin) http://referenceworks.brillonline.com/entries/brill-s-new-pauly/salome-e1028520?s.num=10 Source: Brill’s New Pauly
2 CONT >>>___________________
