2 CONC  after 30 BC (Ios. Ant. Iud. 16,5,2; Ios. BI 1,21,9). Inherited after Herod's death by his sister Salome (Ios. Ant. Iud. 17,8,1; Ios. BI 2,6,3), after her death P. became the property of Livia [2], wife of the emperor Augustus (Io
2 CONC s. Ant. Iud. 18,2,2; Ios. BI 2,9,1).  http://referenceworks.brillonline.com/entries/brill-s-new-pauly/salome-e1028520?s.num=10
