2 CONT =Darius I of Media Atropatene=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Darius I of Media Atropatene, also known as Darius I or Darius (ca. 85-ca. 65 BC), was a Median prince who served as a king of Media Atropatene in c. 65 BC. Little is known of the life of Darius I, however he appeared to have succ
2 CONC eeded his relative, Mithridates, who served as King of Media Atropatene, one year earlier.
2 CONT
2 CONT Darius I was known during his kingship to have been attacked by the Roman Triumvir Pompey with his army. However, the circumstances that led Pompey to attack Media Atropatene are unknown. Sometime in 65 BC, Darius I appeared to ha
2 CONC ve died. His relative, Ariobarzanes I succeeded him as King of Media Atropatene.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darius_I_of_Media_Atropatene
