2 CONT "Herod concluded ten marriages, all for political purposes.  His wives were: Doris, from an unknown family in Jerusalem: married c.47, sent away 37; recalled 14, sent away 7/6. She was the mother of Antipater, who was executed in 
2 CONC 4.  http://www.livius.org/he-hg/herodians/herod_the_great02.html
