1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Antipater the Idumaean [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antipater_the_Idumaean Wikipedia] (d. 43 BC) was the founder of the Herodian Dynasty and father of Herod the Great. According to Africanus and Epiphanius, he was
2 CONC  the son of Herod (I) of Ascalon. According to Josephus, he was the son of Antipas (I).
