1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''
2 CONT =Lucius Junius Silanus Torquatus=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT The younger Silanus (50-66) was the son of the elder's brother, Marcus. His mother is unknown. After his father's murder, he was raised by his paternal aunt Junia Lepida and her husband Gaius Cassius Longinus. A respected young no
2 CONC bleman, he became a rival in his youth to Emperor Nero. Expelled from public life by Nero after his accession to the purple, Silanus was banished to a small country town. He was killed in a stand off with his guard.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucius_Junius_Silanus_Torquatus
