2 CONT The child from this marriage was: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 8435152768110116       i.  Emperor Caius Drusus Nero ROMAN EMPIRE (born in 42 B.C. in Palace Augustus, Roma, Italy - died on 16 March 37 in Roma, Italy) 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~mgholler/Caden/a54.htm#i547458828
