2 CONT
2 CONT "Caligula is best understood as an enfant allowed to be infinitelyterrible by an obsequious Senate and subject to no restraint orauthority, until stopped in his tracks by the daggers of the inevitableassassins."
2 CONT
2 CONT Anthony Blond
