2 CONT 67481222144880936. Marcus Antonius "the Orator" Consul ROMAN EMPIRE,1601,1746 son of Gaius Antonius I ROMAN EMPIRE and Unknown, was born in 143 B.C. in Roma, Italy and died in 87 B.C. in Roma, Italy at age 56. 
