2 CONT # Ptolemy (D), born ca 152 BC. Murdered in 130 BC by Ptolemy VIII
2 CONT
2 CONT Cleopatra II married her brother Ptolemy VIII Euergetes II Physcon in ca 145 BC. They had at least one son:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Ptolemy Memphites. Born between 144 and 142 BC. Murdered by his own father in 130 BC. Ptolemy Memphites may be identical to Ptolemy VII Neos Philopator, but this identification is not universally accepted.
2 CONT
