2 CONT # Julia Vipsania Agrippina or Agrippina Major (mother of Emperor Caligula) in 14 BC
2 CONT # Agrippa Postumus (born after Agrippa's death).
2 CONT *11 BC, Julia marries her stepbrother Tiberius. Their union produces the following:
