2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''
2 CONT =Decimus Haterius Agrippa=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Decimus or Didius Haterius Agrippa was the son of the orator and senator Quintus Haterius. He was tribune of the plebs in 15 and vetoed proposals; was praetor in 17, consul in 22, and senator from 15 on. Agrippa at one time strong
2 CONC ly urged the emperor Tiberius to nominate a limited number of political candidates from each family. He died in 32, a victim of Tiberius' reign of terror. He is not to be confused with Postumus Agrippa, a kinsman (half-uncle).
2 CONT
2 CONT Tacitus describes him as a "somnolent creature". He married Domitia, daughter of Antonia Major and Lucius Domitius Ahenobarbus. Their only child was Quintus Haterius Antoninus (cos. AD 53).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Decimus_Haterius_Agrippa
