3 CONT his father →  Sextus Julius Caesar, II 
3 CONT his father →  Gaius Julius Caesar, I 
3 CONT his brother →  Gaius Julius Caesar, II 
3 CONT his son → Gaius Julius Caesar, III 
3 CONT his son →  Julius Caesar, Roman Dictator 
