2 CONT =Sempronia (sister of the Gracchi)=
2 CONT '''Sempronia''' (170 BC-after 101 BC), was a Roman noblewoman living in the Middle and Late Roman Republic, who was most famous as the sister of the ill-fated '''Tiberius Gracchus''' (died 133 BC) and '''Gaius Gracchus''' (died 12
2 CONC 1 BC), and the wife of a Roman general '''Scipio Aemilianus'''.
