2 CONC 8), 501-02. 9 Joseph A. Fitzmyer, S.J., The Acts of the Apostles: A New Translation With Introduction and Commentary (New Haven; London: Yale University Press, 2008), 501-02. 10 Ben Witherington III, The Acts of the Apostles : A S
