2 CONC r Hadrian  Successor Marcus Aurelius and Lucius Verus  Consort to Faustina  Offspring Faustina the Younger, one other daughter and two sons, all died before 138 (natural); Marcus Aurelius and Lucius Verus (adoptive)  Royal House A
