2 CONT Amnius was born in year 0294.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT + B: Abt. 294
2 CONT
2 CONT Amnius' father was Amnius Julianus Anicius and his mother was Caesonia Manilia.  His paternal grandparents were Sextus Faustus Paulinus Anicius and Amnia Demetrias; his maternal grandparents were  L. C. Ovinius R. M. Bassus and  J
2 CONC unia Maximus.  He was an only child.
2 CONT
