2 CONT
2 CONT 25.► '''Marcus Licinius M. f. P. n. Crassus Dives''', elder son of the triumvir (#20), he was Caesar's quaestor in Gaul, and praefectus of Gallia Cisalpina at the beginning of the Civil War in 49 BC.[47][48][49]◄
