2 CONT General Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT Apama Achaemenid was born 0410 B.C.. She was the daughter of King of Persia and Egypt Artaxerxes II Mnemon Achaemenid.1,2,3 She married Satrap of Daskyleon Pharnabazos II Arshâmid, son of Satrap of Daskyleon Pharnaces I Arshâmid .
2 CONC 1,2,3 Sources: 1. Stuart, R.W. 'Royalty for Commoners', line 414. ; 2. Bryan, K. 'Davidic Descents to the House of Plantagenet' Augustan, Vol. XXV, 16-23. Also called Apama Achaemenid.3
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Apama Achaemenid and Satrap of Daskyleon Pharnabazos II Arshâmid:
2 CONT
2 CONT Satrap of Daskyleon Artabazos III Arshâmid+ b. 0385 B.C., d. 0325 B.C.
2 CONT
2 CONT [S204] Roderick W. Stuart, Royalty for Commoners: The Complete Lineage of John of Gaunt, Son of Edward III, Kings of England, and Queen Philippa (.: ., 3rd Ed., 1998), 414-83. Hereinafter cited as RfC.
2 CONT
2 CONT [S931] A.H. Clough, editor, Plutarch's Lives (Champaign, IL: Project Gutenberg, October 1996). Hereinafter cited as Plutarch's Lives.
2 CONT
