2 CONT
2 CONT Lucius Valerius Septimius Bassus (c. 328-aft. 379 or 383) was a Praefectus Urbi Romae in 379 or 383.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Lucius Valerius Maximus Basilius and first wife Septimia.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Adelphia, born c. 340, daughter of Clodius Celsinus Adelphius and wife Faltonia Betitia Proba, and had a son named Valerius Adelphius Bassus.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
