2 CONC e married Hydranes III of Armenia , son of Hydranes II of Armenia .4 Sources: 1. Stuart, R.W. 'Royalty for Commoners', line 414. ; 2. Gershevitch, I. (ed.) 'The Cambridge History of Iran' Vo. 2, pp.349.
