2 CONT Gaius was born on March 31st, 0250 in Eboracum, York, England.1   Gaius' father was Flavius Eutropius of the Gordiani and his mother was Claudia Crispina Illyria.  His paternal grandparents were Titus Flavius and Gordiana Balba; h
2 CONC is maternal grandparents were Marcus Aurelius Commodus Antonius of Rome and Bruttia Crispin.
