2 CONT
2 CONT STILL OTHER SOURCES SAY HIS PARENTS WERE COLIUS II (NOTES) "OLD KING COL E" (L) COLCHESTER AND STRADA YSTRADWEL (NOTES) VERCH (L) CADFAN AND HIS SI STER WAS THEN HELENA "SAINT" (NOTE)OF THE CROSS (L) COLCHESTERWHILE STI LL OTHER S
2 CONC OURCES SAY HIS WIFE WAS (HIS SISTER?) THE SAME.HELENA "SAINT" (N OTE)OF THE CROSS (L) COLCHESTER.
