1 OCCU Roman Emperor (306-May 22, 337), Empereur de Rome, Roman Emperor, 57th Emporer of Rome, 306-307 Emperor of Roman Empire.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Flavius ​​Hannibalianus (* after 289; † before 337) was a son of the Roman emperor Constantius Chlorus and his second wife Theodora and thus a half-brother of Constantine the Great.
