2 CONT
2 CONT Helena (mother of Constantine the Great)
2 CONT Solidus Helena's Capitoline Museum Flavia Iulia Helena (* 248/250 in Drepanon, today Karamürsel, in Bithynia; † probably on August 18 around 330 in Nicomedia, today İzmit), also Helena of Constantinople, was the mother of the Roma
2 CONC n Emperor Constantine, from to which she was appointed Augusta.
