2 CONC Caus Castle, Salop Death: of executed 375 in Carthage, Africa Death: 375
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Flavius Julius Constantius II of Rome b: 3 OCT 317  Mother: Fausta b: ABT 327
2 CONT
