2 CONT
2 CONT  From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT Marcus Pupienus Maximus (b. c. 140) was a Roman senator.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Clodia Pulchra, born c. 145, daughter of Appius Claudius Pulcher and wife Sextia, and had a son, the Emperor Pupienus.[citation needed]
2 CONT
2 CONT The Historia Augusta, whose testimony is not to be trusted unreservedly, claims he was a blacksmith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:
2 CONT
