2 CONT
2 CONT Dietmar Kienast, Römische Kaisertabelle, 2nd ed. (Darmstadt, 1996) 305. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The account by Otto Seeck , RE VI.2 (1909) 2084-86, has become in part obsolete. 
2 CONT
2 CONT More extensive or specialized studies are: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Vogt, "Heiden und Christen in der Familie Constantins des Grossen," in Eranion: Festschrift för Hildebrecht Hommel (Tübingen 1961) 149-68, esp. 161-63. Also in English: "Pagans and Christians in the Family of Constantine th
2 CONC e Great," in Arnaldo Momigliano, ed., The Conflict between Paganism and Christianity in the Fourth Century (Oxford 1963) 38-55, esp. 48-50. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Patrick Guthrie, "The Execution of Crispus," Phoenix 20 (1966) 325-31. 
2 CONT
2 CONT François Paschoud, Cinq études sur Zosime (Paris, 1975) 24-39. 
2 CONT
2 CONT J. Rougé, "Fausta, femme de Constantin: criminelle ou victime," CahHist. 25 (1980) 3-17. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans A. Pohlsander, "Crispus: Brilliant Career and Tragic End," Historia 33 (1984) 79-106 at 99-106. 
2 CONT
