2 CONT 47Soz. HE 7.25; Ruf. HE 2.18; Aug. Civ. Dei 5.26; Theod. HE 5.17-18. See McLynn (1994), 315-30.
2 CONT
2 CONT 48McLynn (1994), 330-35; Errington (1997b), passim .
2 CONT
2 CONT 49For Theodosius' protection of temples, see C.Th. 16.10.8 (30 November 382), Lib. Or . 30.49-51 (386). On the destruction of the Serapeum, see Soc. HE 5.16-17; Soz. HE 7.15; Ruf. HE 2.23.
2 CONT
2 CONT 50Claud. Laus. Ser . 63-9.
2 CONT
2 CONT 51Soc. HE 4.31; Philost. HE 10.7; Zos. 4.44.
