1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Her ancestry is unknown. Many unsourced Internet genealogies say she was a daughter of [http://www.geni.com/people/Petronius-Maximus-Roman-Emperor/6000000002187572907 Petronius Maximus] and [http://www.geni.com/peo
2 CONC ple/Eparchia/6000000026383362338 (Eparchia)], a hypothetical sister of [http://www.geni.com/people/Avitus-Western-Roman-Emperor/6000000000317314011 Emperor Avitus]. However, the source of that information is not clear.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the reconstruction of Ford Mommaerts, she might have been a granddaughter of [http://www.geni.com/people/Decimus-Rusticus/6000000004089149574 Decimus Rusticus] and and his wife [http://www.geni.com/people/Artemia/6000
2 CONC 000010299987649 Artemia] through an unknown daughter.
2 CONT
2 CONT She and her husband [http://www.geni.com/people/Saint-Hesychius-I-bishop-of-Vienne/6000000000312820005 Hesychius], bishop of Vienne, were the parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Saint-Alcimus-Ecdicius-Avitus-bishop-of-Vienne/6000000000312764214 Alcimius Ecdicius Avitus], bishop of Vienne
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Apollinaris-bishop-of-Valence/6000000026256505754 Apollinaris], bishop of Valence
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source'''
2 CONT
