2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of: Chroma Bourgogne and Ingoberge (Bourgogne) Paris
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of: Clovis (Merovingian) Franken I
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: 492 in Rheims, Marne, Loirt-Atlantique, France
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of:  Ingomera Franken,(Merovingian)  Chlodomer Franken (Merovingian) , Childebert I Franken (Merovingian), Clotaire Soissons (Merovingian) and Clotilda Franken (Merovingian)
2 CONT
2 CONT Died:  June 3, 548 in Monastery Of Saint Martin deTours, Ingre-et-Loire, France Bourgogne
2 CONT
