2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/people/Clovis-I-the-Great-King-of-the-Franks/6000000005913350166?through=6000000005913253971 CHLODOVECH] [Clovis] ([464/67]-Paris [27 Nov] 511, bur Paris, basilique des Saints-Apôtres [later église de Sainte-
2 CONC Geneviève]). m [secondly] (492) [https://www.geni.com/people/Chlotilde-of-Burgundy/6000000001947211337 CHROTECHILDIS] [Clotilde/Rotilde[48]] of Burgundy, daughter of CHILPERICH King of Burgundy & his wife --- ([480]-Tours, monaste
2 CONC ry of Saint-Martin 544 or 548, bur Paris, basilique des Saints-Apôtres [later église de Sainte-Geneviève]).  King Clovis & his second wife had [six] children:[http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/MEROVINGIANS.htm#ClovisIB MEDLANDS] & h
2 CONC ttp://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BURGUNDY%20KINGS.htm#ChrotechildisOrClotildedied544
