2 CONT Relationships:
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT *Clovis/Chlodovech I (446/467 - 511), King of the Franks (482-511)
2 CONT *Clotilde/Rotilde/Chrotechildis (c480-544/548), Queen of the Franks (492-511), nun at St. Martin at Tours (511-544/548)
2 CONT
2 CONT Older Half-Sibling (by Clovis' first partner, an unknown Frankish woman):
