2 CONT
2 CONT *2. Ingomer (493-493)
2 CONT *3. Chlodomer (494/495 - 524), King of the Franks at Orleans (511-524), husband of Guntheuca of Burgundy (her second marriage - first husband unknown)
2 CONT *4. Childebert (497 - 558), King of the Franks at Paris (511-558)
2 CONT *5 Chlothachar (501/502 - 561), King of the Franks at Soissons (511-561)
2 CONT *6 Theodechildis (492/501 - 576), Queen (unknown kingdom), founder of Mauriac monastery in Auvergne
