2 CONT *2. Childerich (d. 561)
2 CONT *3. Charibert (520 - 567), King of the Franks at Paris (561-567), wife of Ingolberga (520-589, repudiated), Merofledis (daughter of a wool-worker), Theodechildis (daughter of a shepherd), and Marcovefa (Mirofledis' sister)
2 CONT *4. Guntchramn/Gontran (532/534 - 592), King of the Franks at Orleans (561-592) husband of Marcatrudis (daughter of Magnachar Duke of the Transjuranian Franks, married 556), Austrechildis/Bobilla (Magnachar's servant, married 566)
2 CONC , and Veneranda (partner/mistress before 549)
