2 CONT Chilperic Of Neustria I 1 2  •Sex: M  •Birth: ABT 538 in Soissons, Aisne, France 3 2  •Death: 584 in Chelles, France 1 2  •Burial: UNKNOWN Saint Vincent Abbey, Paris, Seine, France 3  •Note:  [benbrink.FTW]
