2 CONT 1. -- CLOVIS, the Ripuarian, King of Cologne, living 420; kinsman of CLOVIS I
2 CONT the Great, King of the Salic (from the tribal name Salii) Franks.
2 CONT
2 CONT Avalability: the libraries of Ken, Karen, Kristen, Kevin, Brian, Amy, Adam and
2 CONT FAL
1 NOTE Clovis baptism
2 CONT http://trees.ancestry.com/rd?f=image&guid=20124d17-10f3-4ff8-8949-a2f578e51427&tid=8764362&pid=-861563517
1 NOTE Clovis I
2 CONT http://trees.ancestry.com/rd?f=document&guid=159020eb-23ef-41f6-98c4-42e6af8f7c41&tid=8764362&pid=-861563517
