1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Guntheuc''' or '''Gondioque''' (495-c. 532) was the daughter of the last king of Burgundy. She first married [http://www.geni.com/people/Chlodomir-I-King-of-the-Franks-at-Worms/6000000010395927288 Chlodomir], ki
2 CONC ng of Orléans, her father's conqueror. She gave him three children: [http://www.geni.com/people/Gonthaire-d-Orl%C3%A9ans/6000000001299363174 Gunthar], [http://www.geni.com/people/Theudebald-d-Orl%C3%A9ans/6000000007821560081 Theud
2 CONC ebald], and [http://www.geni.com/people/Clodoald-St-Cloud-d-Orleans/6000000002188089522 Clodoald] (later canonised Saint Cloud).
2 CONT
2 CONT When her husband King Chlodomir was killed in battle in Burgundy, she became the wife of his brother [http://www.geni.com/people/Chlothar-I-le-Vieux-King-of-the-Franks/5585928797380086234 Clothar I], king of Soissons. Her first tw
2 CONC o children, Gunthar and Theudebald, were murdered by her second husband.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
