2 CONT 8.         ''daughter''.  Isidor's Historia Gothorum, Wandalorum, Sueborum records that "Recciarius Reccilani filius" married "Theuderedi regis Gothorum filia"[94].  The Chronicon of Bishop Idatius records that “Rechiarius” marrie
2 CONC d “Theodoris Regis filia” in 449[95].  Her marriage was arranged to confirm her father's alliance with the Suevi in Spain.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (Toulouse 449[96]) REQUIARIO King of the Suevi in Spain, son of REQUILA King of the Suevi (-456). 
