2 CONC anes Getarum, MGH Auct. ant. V.1, p. 132. [236] Wolfram (1998), p. 278. [237] Wolfram (1998), p. 308. [238] Wolfram (1998), p. 308. [259] Iordanes Getarum, MGH Auct. ant. V.1, pp. 77 and 128. [260] Wolfram (1998), p. 274. [261] Wo
2 CONC lfram (1998), p. 274.
