2 CONT Andelfieda married Theodoric Ostrogoths in Rheims,Marne,Loire-Atlantique,France. Theodoric was born about 0454 in Verona, Italy. He was the son of Theodemir Ostrogoths. He died on 30 Aug 0526 . 
