1 NOTE Dagobert I was son of Clothair II or Lothair II, born about 602.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dagobert I, son of Clothair II, reigned as King of the Franks between 628 and 637, succeeded his father.  Dagobert died in 637, and was succeeded by Clovis II.  the Frankish kingdom was also called Merovingia, and later became Imp
2 CONC erial Germany.
