2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Relationships are not proven.''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00215847&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT Little is known of Konstantinos other than that he was the son of Hmayeak/Maiactes/Myakes, a noble from Adrianople/Hadrianopolis (modern-day Edirne in Thrace, the westernmost part of Turkey) and an unnamed daughter of Leo V 'the A
2 CONC rmenian', emperor of Byzantium, and that he was held captive by the Bulgars from 813 until 828. His marriage to https://www.geni.com/people/Pankalo/6000000015565536487?through=6000000056402509942  [??] would produce another empero
2 CONC r of Byzantium, [https://www.geni.com/people/Basil-I-Byzantine-Emperor/6000000002434099128?through=6000000015565536487 Basilius I 'the Macedonian'], as well as a son https://www.geni.com/people/Bardas-I/6000000026443435344?through
2 CONC =6000000003645912098, ?? both of whom would have progeny. Konstantinos is believed to have died between 838 and as early as 827 or as late as about 840.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
