2 CONT The Burgundians were conquered by the Franks in 534. The Franks also recovered Provence from the Ostrogoths and re-attached it to Burgundy in 536. The Merovingian kings of the Franks kept Burgundy as a distinct entity under their 
2 CONC personal rule.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Died after 605
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://familytrees.genopro.com/Azrael/ind02628.htm <nowiki>--------------------</nowiki> Richemir, Duke of the Burgundians & Franconians. He was Patrician of the Burgundians, and Duke in Franconia and Burgundy. The Burgundians wer
2 CONC e conquered by the Franks in 534. The Franks also recovered Provence from the Ostrogoths and re-attached it to Burgundy in 536. The Merovingian kings of the Franks kept Burgundy as a distinct entity under their personal rule.
2 CONT
