2 CONT
2 CONT     * Clovis IV, king (682-695)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Childebert III, king (683-711)
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Amalberge (Saint Amalaberga) before 674, daughter of Wandregisis and Farahild. They had a daughter:
2 CONT
