1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cenred, King of Mercia (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #150348, d. circa 709
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=27 Nov 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Cenred, King of Mercia was the son of Wulfhere, King of Mercia. (1) He died circa 709 at Rome, Italy. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Cenred, King of Mercia succeeded to the title of King Cenred of Mercia in 704. (1) He abdicated as King of Mercia in 709. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:
2 CONT
