0 @N6000000002187597480@ NOTE Vonones II of Parthia
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT
1 CONT Vonones II of Parthia ruled the Parthian Empire briefly in 51. During the reign of his brother Gotarzes II he was governor of Media, and was raised to the throne on Gotarzes' death. However, he died after a few months and was succ
1 CONC eeded by his son Vologases I.
1 CONT
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT Gotarzes II King of Parthia Succeeded by:
1 CONT Vologases I 
