1 CONT 9. married a cousin name unknown
1 CONT
1 CONT 10. married a niece name unknown
1 CONT
1 CONT It is very probable that Herod had more children, especially with the last wives, and also that he had more daughters, as women at that time were not counted as important.
1 CONT
