1 CONT Appian, Bell. Civ. i. 72 
1 CONT Dio Cassius xlv. 47 
1 CONT Plutarch, Marius, 44 
1 CONT Cicero, Orator, 5, Brutus, 37 
1 CONT Quintilian, Instit. iii. 1, 19 
1 CONT O. Enderlein, De M. Antonio oratore (Leipzig, 1882) 
1 CONT This article incorporates text from the 1911 Encyclopædia Britannica, which is in the public domain. 
