1 CONC name he had acquired during his campaigns - epaf??d?t?? , epaphroditus, beloved-of-Aphrodite or (to Romans who read Sulla's Greek title) Venus, due to his skill and luck as a general. 
1 CONT ^ "because the lion cannot defend himself against snares and the fox cannot defend himself against wolves."[1]. 
