1 CONT     * "Buddhism in Central Asia" by B.N. Puri (Motilal Banarsidass Pub, January 1, 2000) ISBN 81-208-0372-8
1 CONT     * "The Greeks in Bactria and India", W.W. Tarn, Cambridge University Press.
