1 CONT     * Memnon, History of Heracleia, Andrew Smith (translator), (2004)
1 CONT     * Smith, William (editor); Dictionary of Greek and Roman Biography and Mythology, "Ariobarzanes III", Boston, (1867)
1 CONT
