0 @N6000000002187821890@ NOTE Smbat II Bagratuni1
1 CONT b. circa 315, d. after 374, #6394
1 CONT Pedigree 
1 CONT      Sources: 1. Toumanoff, C. 'The Orontids of Armenia' in 'Studies in Christian Caucasian History' (1963) pp.337-342. ; 2. Toumanoff, C. 'The Early Bagratids' in La Museon, (1949), pp.21-54. Smbat II Bagratuni was was Presiding 
1 CONC Prince of the Bagratids.. He was born circa 315. He was the son of Bagrat I Bagratuni. He died after 374.  
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
