1 CONC dded to the Frankish crown the fairest of its jewels.  ABT 0508 was granted the insignia of the consular dignity, an honour always highly appreciated by the barbarians, by Emperor Anastasius for his success against the Arian Visig
1 CONC oths event .  Abt 0509 annexed the Rhenish (Ripuarian Frank) Kingdom of Cologne, and succeeded Siegbert and Cloderic partly by right of birth, partly by popular choice.  This final victory crowned Clovis'acquisition of all of Gaul
1 CONC .   Title: The Charlemagne's Ancestors  Author: Gilles Houdry
0 @N6000000004009409759@ NOTE [mylogsdon.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT [db021301.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT [strayhorn.GED]
1 CONT
1 CONT [rw1015.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT Was the king of the Salian Franks who invaded Roman Gaul in 486.  He is credited with having defeated the Gauls, Romans and Visigoths.  He was the first Germanic ruler to adopt Christianity over Arianism.  This occured in 496 when
1 CONC  his wife converted him to Catholisum.   This won him support from the Bishops of Gauls and the pope.    It was their support that allowed him to overcome the Visigoths.
1 CONT
1 CONT Salian Franks lived in the lowlands along the Rhine river.
1 CONT
1 CONT The other branck of the Franks, the Ripuarians, lived in the cities of Trier and Cologne in Germany.
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT There are two periods of Frankish history.  The first, the Merovingian, began in 481 and ended in 751.  The Carolingian began in 751 and lasted until 987 by  which time the empire broke up into the counties of France, Germany and 
1 CONC Italy.
