0 @N6000000002187705387@ NOTE Hermanfrid
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
1 CONT Hermanfrid was the son of Bisinus, King of the Thuringian Franks, and Basina. He and his brothers Baderic and Berthar succeeded their father to the rule over the Thuringians. After Hermanfrid defeated Berthar in battle, he invited
1 CONC  king Theuderic I of Austrasia to help him defeat Baderic in return for half of the kingdom. Baderic was defeated and killed, but the kingdom was kept by Hermanfrid. In 532, Theuderic got his revenge when he, his son Theudebert, a
1 CONC nd his brother Chlotar invaded and took Thuringia.
1 CONT
1 CONT Hermanfrid married Amalaberga, daughter of Amalafrida and Theodemir.
