0 @N6000000002187821994@ NOTE Hrahat Mamikonean of Taraun1,2
1 CONT b. circa 640, #6354
1 CONT Pedigree 
1 CONT      The ancestory of Hrahat of the Mamikonids, father to Gregory, David and probably Samuel, is not clear. It would appear that one or more of his sons was Presiding Prince of the Mamikonids and it is possible therefore that Hrah
1 CONC at is a grandson of Hamazasp II. Hrahat Mamikonean of Taraun was born circa 640. He was the son of Hamazasp III Mamikonean, marzpan of Armenia and N. N. Rštouni.  
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT      Child of Hrahat Mamikonean of Taraun: 
1 CONT   David II Mamikonean of Taraun+   b. c 680, d. 744 
1 CONT
