1 CONT 1  NAME St. Clothilda (Clotild) of /Burgundy/ 2  SOUR S033320 3  DATA 4  TEXT Date of Import: Jan 17, 2001 1  NAME St. Clothilde /De Burgundy/ 1  DEAT 2  DATE 3 JUN 548 2  PLAC Tours, Ingre-et-Loire, France
