0 @N6000000002244390026@ NOTE Clovis was the Merovingian founder of the Frankish kingdom that dominated
1 CONT much of western Europe in the early Middle Ages. At Soissons, in 486, he
1 CONT defeated Syagrius, the last Roman ruler in Gaul. His family was secure in an
1 CONT unrivaled dominance that was to last until the 8th century.
