0 @N6000000002188089518@ NOTE Guntheuc
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Guntheuc of Gondioque (495-c.532) was the daughter of the last king of Burgundy. She first married Chlodomer, king of Orléans, her father's conqueror. She gave him three children: Gunthar, Theudebald, and Clodoald (later canonised
1 CONC  Saint Cloud).
1 CONT
1 CONT She later married her late first husband's brother Clotaire I, king of Soissons. Her first two children, Gunthar and Theudebald, were murdered by her second husband.
