0 @N6000000003495155441@ NOTE
1 CONT According to legend Merowig was conceived when Clodio's wife encountered a Quinotaur, a sea monster which could change shapes, while swimming. Though never stated, it is implied that she was impregnated by it. This legend was rela
1 CONC ted by Fredegar in the seventh century, and may have been known earlier.
