1 CONT Cologne and Duke Adagisile; then, on Dagobert's death, by Chunibert and Pepin
1 CONT I, the mayor of the palace (d.640); and finallyby Pepin's son, Grimoald,
1 CONT mayor of the palace from 642 or 643 until the king's death.
