0 @N6000000002322297598@ NOTE Dagobert was packed off to an Irish monastery following the death of his
1 CONT father in 656, and the Austrasian throne was taken by Childebert the adopted
1 CONT son of Grimoald, the Austrasian mayor of the palace. After the downfall of
1 CONT Grimoald and Childebert, Dagobert's cousin Chlotar III, king of Neustria,
1 CONT secured the throne for Childeric II in 662. On Childeric's assassination in
1 CONT 675, Dagobert was traced and restored to the throne in 676. His murder 3 years
1 CONT years later led to a nominal unity of all Frankish lands under Theodoric III.
