0 @N6000000001353750686@ NOTE [blended.FTW]
1 CONT [mergebase.FTW]
1 CONT King of Neustria 715-720
1 CONT King of the Franks 719-720
1 CONT Chilperic II succeeded to a puppet position as Merovingian Frankish king during the reign of the Austrasian Mayor Charles Martel. He had formerly been a priest by the name of Daniel, and so was educated and refused to be Charles' 
1 CONC puppet. Charles was firmly backed by his Neustrian Palace Mayor, and by Duke Eudo of the semi-independent duch of Aquitaine. In 719, Charles defeated Eudo and took King Chilperic II hostage. Eudo was granted mercy on the provision
1 CONC  that he acknowledged Chilperic as King of all the Franks and Charles as Mayor of all the palaces in Gaul. Eudo had no choice but to accept, but Chilperic died the nextyear and Charles lost his positions.
1 CONT [Fix.FTW]
1 CONT King of Neustria 715-720
